        "original_id": "db0b62f0-e997-54f2-ba2d-972dc1da78ef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Tristan und Isolde, Ariane et Barbe-bleue\n- People: Richard Wagner, Gottfried von Strassburg, Maurice Maeterlinck, Charles Perrault\n- Concepts: opera, music drama, libretto, adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Tristan und Isolde is a three-act opera or music drama by Richard Wagner.\n- Richard Wagner wrote the German libretto for Tristan und Isolde.\n- Tristan und Isolde is based largely on the romance by Gottfried von Strassburg.\n- Ariane et Barbe-bleue has a French libretto adapted with very few changes from the symbolist play of the same name by Maurice Maeterlinck.\n- Maurice Maeterlinck's play Ariane et Barbe-bleue is itself loosely based on the French literary tale La Barbe bleue by Charles Perrault.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
